<!--
  CSP.Clio.StagingDelete.exe - the separate delete EXE of the staging pipeline.
  It runs ONE delete pass (records deleted in Clio are moved to the *_Deleted tables of Clio_Staging) and records it in control.DeleteRun.
  It is started by the cycle supervisor of CSP.Clio.StagingSync.exe (argument: cycle), or can be run alone.

  The code is not copied: the shared source files of CSP.Clio.StagingSync (the parent folder) are compiled into this EXE by link, so the tested
  StagingSync project is untouched. The EXE is written next to CSP.Clio.StagingSync.exe (the bin folder of the parent project) and uses the SAME
  App.config (linked), so both EXEs always use the same connection strings and settings.
-->
